OpenTune Beats — third-party notices

This file lists the third-party Rust crates compiled into the binary, with their licenses. It is
kept in the repository and ships next to the executable in the release archive, so that a binary
distribution carries the notices it is required to carry.

Current state (0.1.0)

  No third-party crate is compiled into this build: the binary contains only the code in this
  repository. Once the analysis engine adds dependencies, a generator reads Cargo.lock and writes
  this file; until then it is maintained by hand, and the list above is exact.

The Beat This! model weights and the beat-this-rs port are described in NOTICE. They belong to a
later build of the analysis engine and are not part of the current binary.
